  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SHO_2023_Aardbeving Turkije en Syri&#xEB;</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Save the Children is responding with our local partners, providing lifesaving assistance in both T&#xFC;rkiye and Syria. Save the Children and its partners were able to respond to quickly to provide urgent support to children and their families and are continuing to support children and their families to support immediate needs, with a view to supporting and advocating for families to be able to recover and piece their lives back together.</narrative>
  </description>
